WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.579 --> 00:00:18.641
Everyone was having fun at Zann's party.

2
00:00:19.761 --> 00:00:24.384
His parents had returned from the palace just in time to greet the first guests.

3
00:00:25.605 --> 00:00:31.108
Boz, Teplo, and Saffa had arrived a little late, but they all seemed to be enjoying themselves now.

4
00:00:32.168 --> 00:00:37.750
The delicious food and fancy decorations that Zann and his parents had conjured made the house look festive.

5
00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:40.070
"This is great, Zann!"

6
00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:40.730
Perda said.

7
00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:42.891
"Your First City friends are really nice."

8
00:00:42.911 --> 00:00:49.653
"Thanks." Zann had invited several kids from his new school, and most of them had come.

9
00:00:50.693 --> 00:00:52.194
Mari hadn't shown up yet though.

10
00:00:53.274 --> 00:00:56.495
He hoped she wasn't insulted because he'd invited her at the last minute.

11
00:00:56.515 --> 00:00:58.635
"Over here, Zann!"

12
00:00:58.876 --> 00:01:00.076
Gliss called from nearby.

13
00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:03.241
"We're going to play Conjure and Vanish."

14
00:01:04.402 --> 00:01:06.604
Zann smiled, forgetting about Mari.

15
00:01:07.324 --> 00:01:10.346
Conjure and Vanish was one of his favorite party games.

16
00:01:11.347 --> 00:01:12.548
He and Perda hurried over.

17
00:01:12.568 --> 00:01:17.351
"It's your party, so you go first," Gliss told him.

18
00:01:19.513 --> 00:01:23.476
"Okay." Zann rubbed his hands together to create magic friction.

19
00:01:24.316 --> 00:01:29.660
He closed his eyes and focused on the object he wanted to conjure—a swamp shiner.

20
00:01:30.620 --> 00:01:34.101
That was a type of lamp he'd used when exploring the swamp back home.

21
00:01:35.221 --> 00:01:39.763
He then used a Vanishing spell to make the lamp invisible before anyone could see it.

22
00:01:39.783 --> 00:01:41.363
"Are you ready?"

23
00:01:41.683 --> 00:01:42.883
a kid asked eagerly.

24
00:01:43.984 --> 00:01:45.924
Zann opened his eyes and nodded.

25
00:01:45.944 --> 00:01:48.805
"Gliss, you can go first," he said.

26
00:01:49.765 --> 00:01:52.906
She reached for the invisible item, feeling all around it.

27
00:01:52.926 --> 00:01:55.067
"Is it a drinking glass?"

28
00:01:55.087 --> 00:01:59.028
"Nope." Zann grinned and pointed to Perda.

29
00:01:59.308 --> 00:02:02.961
"Next?" Perda smiled as soon as she felt the object.

30
00:02:02.981 --> 00:02:05.123
"That's easy!

31
00:02:05.523 --> 00:02:06.784
It's a swamp shiner.

32
00:02:07.924 --> 00:02:11.907
You made them all the time when we used to sneak out at night to look for flash

33
00:02:11.967 --> 00:02:15.049
fish." "Right!"

34
00:02:15.309 --> 00:02:16.249
Zann grinned at her.

35
00:02:16.269 --> 00:02:18.411
"Now it's your turn to conjure something."

36
00:02:20.112 --> 00:02:22.973
The sun went down, and everyone was still having fun.

37
00:02:23.914 --> 00:02:26.736
Some kids danced while others talked and ate snacks.

38
00:02:27.932 --> 00:02:30.693
One group of kids played a game of exploding dominoes.

39
00:02:31.653 --> 00:02:34.954
Zann was drinking some airberry punch when his father hurried over.

40
00:02:34.974 --> 00:02:40.396
"Your mother and I just got called back to the palace for an emergency meeting," Nax said.

41
00:02:40.416 --> 00:02:42.436
"Another one?"

42
00:02:42.696 --> 00:02:43.217
Zann said.

43
00:02:43.237 --> 00:02:44.417
"What's going on?"

44
00:02:45.517 --> 00:02:47.038
His father looked distracted.

45
00:02:47.058 --> 00:02:48.198
"We'll tell you later.

46
00:02:49.138 --> 00:02:51.639
Right now, just keep having fun with your friends."

47
00:02:52.759 --> 00:02:54.460
He zapped away with Zann's mother.

48
00:02:55.304 --> 00:02:58.567
Zann suddenly noticed that Boz was nowhere in sight.

49
00:02:59.568 --> 00:03:01.470
Neither were Teplo or Saffa.

50
00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:06.094
Then he spotted Perda standing by the door to the backyard.

51
00:03:07.175 --> 00:03:10.658
Seeing her made him feel happy and sad at the same time.

52
00:03:11.718 --> 00:03:14.020
He was glad that Perda and his other friends were there.

53
00:03:14.541 --> 00:03:16.583
But they would have to go home in a couple of days.

54
00:03:17.503 --> 00:03:20.246
How long would it be before they were all together again?

55
00:03:21.267 --> 00:03:23.372
He hurried over to Perda.

56
00:03:23.392 --> 00:03:24.513
"Want to get some fresh air?"

57
00:03:24.693 --> 00:03:25.153
he asked.

58
00:03:26.033 --> 00:03:27.374
"Sure." She smiled.

59
00:03:29.195 --> 00:03:30.675
They went out onto the patio.

60
00:03:31.956 --> 00:03:35.877
The air was cool, with a slight breeze that ruffled Perda's hair.

61
00:03:35.897 --> 00:03:41.099
"Wow, you look—," Zann blurted out, and then stopped himself.

62
00:03:41.119 --> 00:03:43.440
"What?" Perda asked.

63
00:03:44.641 --> 00:03:45.501
Zann gulped.

64
00:03:46.862 --> 00:03:48.703
He'd been about to say that she looked pretty.

65
00:03:49.063 --> 00:03:51.644
But suddenly he felt awkward about saying that.

66
00:03:52.576 --> 00:03:55.138
"Uh, you look older," he said instead.

67
00:03:56.078 --> 00:03:56.819
Then he laughed.

68
00:03:57.159 --> 00:03:59.081
"Two months older, I guess."

69
00:04:00.201 --> 00:04:02.183
Perda blinked, seeming confused.

70
00:04:03.103 --> 00:04:05.405
Before she could respond, the door burst open.

71
00:04:05.425 --> 00:04:07.866
"There you are, Zann!"

72
00:04:08.127 --> 00:04:09.508
a kid from school exclaimed.

73
00:04:09.528 --> 00:04:13.470
"There's a huge protest starting outside right now."

74
00:04:13.490 --> 00:04:16.873
"Yeah!" Another schoolmate came up behind him.

75
00:04:16.893 --> 00:04:20.115
"Laddno said it's going to be the biggest one yet!

76
00:04:20.595 --> 00:04:21.576
Let's go check it out!"

77
00:04:22.464 --> 00:04:24.005
The pair rushed for the front door.

78
00:04:24.646 --> 00:04:25.746
Perda started to follow.

79
00:04:25.766 --> 00:04:27.908
"Wait, where are you going?"

80
00:04:28.128 --> 00:04:28.788
Zann asked.

81
00:04:28.808 --> 00:04:32.231
"We should see what's going on," she said.

82
00:04:33.191 --> 00:04:34.712
Everyone headed out the front door.

83
00:04:37.594 --> 00:04:41.017
Zann sighed, not very interested in another protest.

84
00:04:41.877 --> 00:04:45.219
But his best friends were following the crowd, so Zann followed too.

85
00:04:45.239 --> 00:04:48.882
"It's at the palace square," one of the kids called.

86
00:04:49.742 --> 00:04:51.784
"Let's zap there so we don't miss anything."

87
00:04:52.832 --> 00:04:55.334
The kids from First City started disappearing.

88
00:04:56.215 --> 00:04:57.456
Perda grabbed Zann's hand.

89
00:04:57.476 --> 00:05:00.398
"You'll have to zap us there," she said.

90
00:05:00.418 --> 00:05:03.281
"I don't remember how to get to the palace."

91
00:05:04.301 --> 00:05:07.064
Zann nodded, grabbing Gliss with his free hand.

92
00:05:07.884 --> 00:05:09.806
She was already holding onto Darb's arm.

93
00:05:09.826 --> 00:05:11.927
"Zap!" Zann cried.

94
00:05:12.868 --> 00:05:17.272
When they landed, Zann saw a massive crowd in the square outside the palace.

95
00:05:18.112 --> 00:05:19.894
People waved signs and shouted.

96
00:05:19.914 --> 00:05:22.176
"Wow," Perda said.

97
00:05:22.592 --> 00:05:24.013
"This is crazy!"

98
00:05:25.113 --> 00:05:25.853
Zann nodded.

99
00:05:25.873 --> 00:05:30.936
"I can't believe the king and queen are allowing a protest like this so close to the palace."

100
00:05:32.076 --> 00:05:35.397
Just then Laddno stepped into view near the palace doors.

101
00:05:35.417 --> 00:05:38.159
"This is an important day!"

102
00:05:38.419 --> 00:05:38.919
he shouted.

103
00:05:38.939 --> 00:05:42.941
"Please welcome my esteemed guests."

104
00:05:44.041 --> 00:05:47.763
The palace doors opened, and the king and queen walked out.

105
00:05:47.783 --> 00:05:49.744
"What's going on?"

106
00:05:49.984 --> 00:05:50.504
Gliss said.

107
00:05:51.492 --> 00:05:53.313
"They're not joining his movement, are they?"

108
00:05:53.333 --> 00:05:57.616
"We have an important announcement," the king said.

109
00:05:58.557 --> 00:06:00.018
His voice sounded shaky.

110
00:06:01.079 --> 00:06:02.560
The queen took her husband's hand.

111
00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:07.683
"The king and I are stepping down as your leaders—immediately."

112
00:06:08.824 --> 00:06:10.225
Zann felt stunned.

113
00:06:11.486 --> 00:06:14.768
Some people shouted out in dismay, while others cheered.

114
00:06:14.788 --> 00:06:17.690
"Wow," Perda exclaimed.

115
00:06:18.211 --> 00:06:21.581
"This is really—" "Aah!"

116
00:06:22.021 --> 00:06:25.503
Another mysterious Share suddenly seized Zann.

117
00:06:26.543 --> 00:06:28.985
Images of rolling waves filled his mind.

118
00:06:30.245 --> 00:06:31.206
He heard the voice again.

119
00:06:31.706 --> 00:06:32.246
Who was it?

120
00:06:33.447 --> 00:06:36.649
Zann squeezed his eyes shut and tried to focus on the voice.

121
00:06:37.689 --> 00:06:40.571
A terrified-looking face flashed into view.

122
00:06:41.772 --> 00:06:44.453
Zann gasped, and his eyes popped open.

123
00:06:45.394 --> 00:06:46.734
His friends were staring at him.

124
00:06:46.754 --> 00:06:48.535
"Did it happen again?"

125
00:06:48.836 --> 00:06:49.496
Perda asked.

126
00:06:50.568 --> 00:06:51.769
"Yes," Zann said.

127
00:06:51.789 --> 00:06:54.132
"I know who's trying to contact me."

128
00:06:54.152 --> 00:06:56.634
"Who?" Gliss asked.

129
00:06:57.635 --> 00:06:58.496
Zann gulped.

130
00:06:58.516 --> 00:06:59.657
"It's Ello!"

131
00:06:59.677 --> 00:07:01.538
"From Skellia?"

132
00:07:01.819 --> 00:07:02.619
Darb exclaimed.

133
00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:09.045
Zann nodded, thinking back to the drowning world they'd visited and the boy who'd helped them escape from

134
00:07:09.106 --> 00:07:13.349
it. "Ello is still stuck in Skellia," he said grimly.

135
00:07:13.369 --> 00:07:15.672
"And he needs our help!"
